{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"希伯来书","commonName":"希伯来书","title":"希伯来书","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"2c6f2c6885c0d90704c9582e6fe7720be42b3b4d3b820007897ccb662d08a6fa","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":303},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["更美之约的大祭司"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我们所讲的事，其中第一要紧的，就是我们有这样的大祭司，已经坐在天上至大者宝座的右边，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["在圣所，就是真帐幕里，作执事；这帐幕是主所支的，不是人所支的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["凡大祭司都是为献礼物和祭物设立的，所以这位大祭司也必须有所献的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他若在地上，必不得为祭司，因为已经有照律法献礼物的祭司。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他们供奉的事本是天上事的形状和影像，正如摩西将要造帐幕的时候，蒙 神警戒他，说：「你要谨慎，作各样的物件都要照着在山上指示你的样式。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["如今耶稣所得的职任是更美的，正如他作更美之约的中保；这约原是凭更美之应许立的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["那前约若没有瑕疵，就无处寻求后约了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["所以主指责他的百姓说",{"noteId":8},"：",{"text":"日子将到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要与以色列家和犹大家另立新约，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不像我拉着他们祖宗的手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"领他们出埃及的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与他们所立的约。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们不恒心守我的约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不理他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主又说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些日子以后，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我与以色列家所立的约乃是这样：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要将我的律法放在他们里面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"写在他们心上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要作他们的 神；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要作我的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们不用各人教导自己的乡邻和自己的弟兄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说：你该认识主；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们从最小的到至大的，都必认识我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要宽恕他们的不义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再记念他们的罪愆。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["既说新约，就以前约为旧了；但那渐旧渐衰的，就必快归无有了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"-","text":"或译：所以主指前约的缺欠说","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}